#. ~ Description for pair of 2-by-shin guards
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A pair of improvised shin guards made from broken pieces of a plank that are"
" tied to your shins with rags and string.  They offer good protection, but "
"are really hard to run with."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pair of chitin leg guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of chitin leg guards"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""

#. ~ Description for pair of chitin leg guards
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A pair of leg guards made from the exoskeletons of insects.  Light and "
"durable."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pair of biosilicified chitin leg guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of biosilicified chitin leg guards"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""

#. ~ Description for pair of biosilicified chitin leg guards
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A pair of leg guards crafted from the carefully cleaned and pruned "
"biosilicified exoskeletons of acidic ants.  Acid-resistant and very durable."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "turnout trousers"
msgid_plural "turnout trousers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'turnout trousers'}
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A heavy pair of protective overalls worn by firefighters.  Highly resistant "
"to heat and flame, they provide excellent protection from injury."
msgstr ""
"Um pesado par de macacões de proteção usados pelos bombeiros. Altamente "
"resistente ao calor e à chama, eles fornecem excelente proteção contra "
"ferimentos."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "chainmail leggings"
msgid_plural "pairs of chainmail leggings"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""

#. ~ Description for chainmail leggings
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Customized chainmail legs.  Their straps keep everything in place, and the "
"lack of toes and heels allows them to work perfectly well with footwear."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "XL chainmail leggings"
msgid_plural "pairs of XL chainmail leggings"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""

#. ~ Description for XL chainmail leggings
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Customized chainmail legs for the largest of transhumans.  Their straps keep"
" everything in place, and the lack of toes and heels allows them to work "
"perfectly well with footwear."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
