#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "poppy bush"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for poppy bush
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An invasive species brought to Earth by the invaders and found it quite to "
"its liking.  It spiny, writhing fronds make it look more like a jungle bush "
