"Moving causes you to lose your iron skin.\n"
"\n"
"-1 bash, cut, and stab armor.\n"
"Lasts 6 turns.  Stacks 6 times."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Toad's Meditation"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of buff 'Toad's Meditation' for martial art '{'str': 'Toad
#. Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"By concentrating for a moment, you can bolster the strength of your iron skin.\n"
"\n"
"+3 bash, cut, and stab armor.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Toad's Venom"
