#. ~ Description of buff 'Mind over Body' for martial art '{'str': 'Diamond
#. Mind'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your well trained mind allows you to briefly shrug off the effects of pain while in combat.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Accuracy.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn.  Stacks 2 times"
msgstr ""

