"nothing less.  Iron Heart students practice endlessly to achieve a complete "
"and absolute mastery of their weapon.  Users of Iron Heart are easily able "
"to disable and dispatch opponents with superior skill and technique.  Only "
"the fool would attempt to fight an Iron Heart student head-on."
msgstr ""

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Iron Heart'}'
