"A person wrapped up in bandages in a hospital bed is pictured on the front of this card.  \"Get well soon!!!\n"
"\n"
" Torrance, I'm sorry you feel ill but many new colonists forget to process any foodstuffs from Salus IV to remove the macronutrient.\""
