#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Extremely resilient floor made from carefully placed rebar and poured "
"alchemical concrete, capable of providing protection from the elements.  As "
"for the matching roof, it still requires supporting walls, otherwise it may "
"very well cave in."
